# Turtles Forever (Black Lotus and Mox Pearl pay {3}{W}): Bot1 searches the library and outside the game together for exactly four
# legendary creature cards with different names (Lutri and Isamaru from the library, Lurrus and Kaheera from the sideboard; a Savannah
# Lions outside is not legendary,
# a fifth, Thalia, is legendary but five is refused: the search is for no more than four; Bot2's own library holds a Lutri that must stay). Bot2 chooses two of the four, Lutri (from the
# library) and Lurrus (from outside the game): they go into Bot1's hand, and Isamaru and Kaheera are shuffled into Bot1's library
# (Kaheera from outside the game among them), so the Kaheera is a library card afterwards and the sideboard keeps the Lions and Thalia.

